Third-party notice: this MIT license applies only to this project's own source
code (app/main.swift, webui/, *.sh, *.command and build scripts).

This application invokes gphoto2 and FFmpeg as separate child processes over
pipes (arm's-length / mere aggregation), and DOES redistribute their
pre-compiled binaries plus their dynamic-library dependencies inside the
application bundle (Contents/Resources/bin and Contents/Resources/lib), so that
the app runs without Homebrew installed.

Those bundled components remain under their own licenses (GPL-2.0-or-later,
GPL-3.0-or-later, LGPL-2.1, LGPL-2.0, Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD variants, IJG,
libpng, FTL, libtiff, GD, Fontconfig, 0BSD). The complete license texts are
shipped inside the bundle under Contents/Resources/LICENSES/, and the full
component inventory with versions, upstream sources and the written offer for
corresponding source is in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
